      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Blue Sky Property is delighted to bring No. 18 Harbour Grove, Lower Point Road to the market.\r\n\r\nHarbour Grove is a small, highly sought-after residential development of three and four bedroom homes located in a mature setting and within walking distance of Dundalk Town Centre.\r\n\r\nThis superb semi-detached home is presented in excellent condition throughout and offers well-proportioned, bright family accommodation with the added benefit of a generous rear garden and patio with side entrance and off-street parking to the front.\r\n\r\nFor first time buyers, second time movers or investors, this is an outstanding opportunity to acquire a quality home in a proven location. We would highly recommend this property as a must view.\r\n\r\nBlue Sky Property and their servants or agents assume no responsibility for and give no guarantees, undertakings or warranties concerning the accuracy, completeness or up to date nature of the information and do not accept any liability whatsoever arising from any errors or omissions. The information does not constitute or form part of a contract and cannot be relied on as a representation of fact. Subject to contract / contract denied. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs provided for guidance only.\r\nAccommodation is entered via a bright hallway with guest wc, the livingroom is to the front with double doors leading into the spacious kitchen - dining room and patio doors out to the enclosed rear garden. Upstairs you have the master bedroom with en-suite bathroom, two further bedrooms and the family bathroom. \r\n\r\nFor viewing and further information contact sole agent Blue Sky Property on 042-9329333. Guide Price €325,000. \r\n\r\nLocation : \r\nHarbour Grove enjoys a prime location just off the Lower Point Road, in a mature residential area close to a bus corridor and within easy walking distance of Dundalk Town Centre and all its amenities.\r\n\r\nExcellent local schools nearby including St. Joseph's National School, Muirhevna Mor NS, St. Mary's NS and De La Salle, Colaiste Ris & DKIT within a short drive.\r\n\r\nIdeally placed for access to Dundalk Retail Park, Longwalk Shopping Centre, Dunnes Stores, Omniplex Cinema, DKIT & DKIT Sport."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor : \r\nEntrance Hallway 2.02m x 5.12m\r\nLiving Room 3.12m x 5.12m\r\nGuest W.C. 1.87m x 0.86m\r\nKitchen / Dining Room 5.24m x 3.11m\r\n\r\nFirst Floor : \r\nLanding 3.66m x 2.47m\r\nMaster Bedroom 3.12m x 4.06m\r\nEn-Suite 2.16m x 0.84m\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.01m x 2.54m\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.01m x 2.60m\r\nBathroom 2.55m x 2.0m"
